---
const stats = [
  { number: '14+',       label: 'Years Experience' },
  { number: 'MSc & BSc', label: 'Degrees'           },
  { number: '4',         label: 'Languages'         },
  { number: '3',         label: 'Countries'         },
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-28 px-8 flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-center text-accent mb-14">About Me</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed opacity-90">
        <p>
          I'm a Senior Technical Business Analyst specialising in identity and access management
          on Microsoft's identity platform, working where business needs, security and technical
          design meet. At Condatis I take customer and workforce identity projects from discovery
          workshops through solution design, integration and acceptance to go-live.
        </p>
        <p>
          My deepest experience is with Azure AD B2C custom policies and the orchestration services
          between B2C and downstream applications: user journeys, claims, token flows and API
          contracts over OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect and REST. I also work on Entra ID Governance and
          Entra Verified ID, and I'm particularly interested in B2C → Entra External ID migrations
          and building security in from the start.
        </p>
        <p>
          I moved to Edinburgh for my MSc at Edinburgh Napier University and have built my career
          here, including four years at Avaloq on core banking
          lending products. Across ~14 years, what I bring is the ability to frame the real problem,
          bring the right people into the room, and turn requirements and regulation (GDPR,
          ISO 27001) into specifications engineers can build from.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        {stats.map(stat => (
          <div class="bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center border border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white/10">
            <span class="block text-3xl font-bold text-accent mb-2">{stat.number}</span>
            <span class="text-sm opacity-70">{stat.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
